<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-044
  ROLE: Verifies

[VERIFICATION]
UID: VER-BE-005
METHOD: Demonstration
TITLE: voetbal.nl options in the web admin
STATEMENT: >>>
Open the feed settings of a voetbal.nl feed in the profile page and in the user admin page: the home/away switch and the own team field are shown, and saving them changes the titles. For another feed the options are not shown.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Not automated: browser UI. Not yet performed.
<<<
