[VERIFICATION]
UID: VER-BE-007
METHOD: Test
TITLE: Own team detection
STATEMENT: >>>
The own team is the name found in the most match titles (also when not in every title), is filled in on sync and on adding a feed, and an edited own team is kept on later syncs.
<<<
TEST: >>>
